  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Good morning, Ahmed.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 124.84,
      "end_time": 126.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Good to meet you.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 126.28,
      "end_time": 127.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Good to meet you too, finally.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 127.4,
      "end_time": 129.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Good to meet you.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 129.04,
      "end_time": 129.72
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 132.05,
      "end_time": 132.77
    },
    {
      "text": "How was your trip?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 133.09,
      "end_time": 134.13
    },
    {
      "text": "It was great to be in London, but the show itself was a bit disappointing.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 136.45,
      "end_time": 140.49
    },
    {
      "text": "It was spread all over town and I found south by Southwest used to be solid and now it's just tried to be everything to everybody and it doesn't really work that way.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 140.49,
      "end_time": 151.97
    },
    {
      "text": "That's.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 153.09,
      "end_time": 153.65
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, I mean, yeah, it's, it's glad to be.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 157.26,
      "end_time": 161.02
    },
    {
      "text": "I, I guess you'll be glad to be back, right?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 161.02,
      "end_time": 163.26
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you in, are you in the UK?",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 163.66,
      "end_time": 165.18
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I'm actually in Pakistan.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 166.06,
      "end_time": 167.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, just wait for Pete360 and I.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 170.38,
      "end_time": 178.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Mean I've got no idea what this process looks like.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 178.02,
      "end_time": 180.58
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'll be, I'll, I'll be happily guided by your suggestions.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 180.58,
      "end_time": 186.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 186.61,
      "end_time": 187.77
    },
    {
      "text": "This is just a really like initial high level calls.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 187.77,
      "end_time": 190.89
    },
    {
      "text": "You just have to introduce yourself to Feed and then let's like there are any next steps or any follow ups or any data or financials, but this is really just so you guys can see if there's like a strategic alignment between you guys and move on the next steps.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 190.89,
      "end_time": 210.4
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 301.62,
      "end_time": 302.02
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm in Spain.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 305.62,
      "end_time": 306.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Experience.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 310.9,
      "end_time": 311.3
    },
    {
      "text": "But one of my web developers is from Pakistan and he's now studying his PhD in Australia.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 316.56,
      "end_time": 323.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, wow.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 324.32,
      "end_time": 325.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 325.28,
      "end_time": 325.76
    },
    {
      "text": "And he's, he's really liking it.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 325.92,
      "end_time": 327.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So it's, it's nice, nice to see these global interactions, you know, work out really well.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 327.84,
      "end_time": 335.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that's, that's great.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 335.68,
      "end_time": 336.92
    },
    {
      "text": "That's quite active here.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 336.92,
      "end_time": 338
    },
    {
      "text": "I see a lot of Pakistanis.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 338.65,
      "end_time": 340.01
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean you won't see like a lot of Pakistanis in investment banking, but there are a lot of them in like web development, digital marketing.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 340.01,
      "end_time": 348.41
    },
    {
      "text": "That's great to see.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 350.49,
      "end_time": 351.53
    },
    {
      "text": "All people are very techy when it comes to these things, but yeah, I was really into finance and everything, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 351.61,
      "end_time": 361.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, he's, he's really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 362.49,
      "end_time": 363.93
    },
    {
      "text": "How long have you been working with, with Adam, With Andy.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 363.93,
      "end_time": 368.63
    },
    {
      "text": "It's been almost two years now.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 369.11,
      "end_time": 370.87
    },
    {
      "text": "So I think you worked with Andy before as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 373.67,
      "end_time": 377.43
    },
    {
      "text": "Back in 2023.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 382.47,
      "end_time": 383.75
    },
    {
      "text": "That was.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 383.75,
      "end_time": 384.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Is Pete going to join us?",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 392.07,
      "end_time": 393.39
    },
    {
      "text": "Have you heard from him?",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 393.39,
      "end_time": 394.39
    },
    {
      "text": "I just sent email.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 395.24,
      "end_time": 396.52
    },
    {
      "text": "He did accept the.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 397.16,
      "end_time": 398.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't see, I didn't see him accept the invite.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 401.32,
      "end_time": 403.88
    },
    {
      "text": "That's why I'm asking.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 403.88,
      "end_time": 404.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I think.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 407.48,
      "end_time": 408.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I, I got this text, I just sent him again.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 408.12,
      "end_time": 424.29
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean they usually.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 425.65,
      "end_time": 426.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 427.09,
      "end_time": 427.89
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm having a hard time hearing your audio too.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 431.41,
      "end_time": 433.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Ahmed.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 433.89,
      "end_time": 434.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it better?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 439.57,
      "end_time": 440.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Say it again.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 442.45,
      "end_time": 443.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I, I just said is it better?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 444.53,
      "end_time": 446.45
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's better.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 447.31,
      "end_time": 448.19
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 448.27,
      "end_time": 448.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I think it's probably I have like two or three mics connected.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 450.19,
      "end_time": 453.35
    },
    {
      "text": "It kind of automatically shows it between which is we can wait like five more minutes and then I'll just reschedule the.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 453.35,
      "end_time": 557.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I just rank him his number.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 561.16,
      "end_time": 563.32
    },
    {
      "text": "But it.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 563.32,
      "end_time": 575.25
    },
    {
      "text": "The US with 5% of the world's population, consumes 80% of its opioids.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 612.3,
      "end_time": 617.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Legal medication misused.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 617.5,
      "end_time": 619.26
    },
    {
      "text": "Plus street drugs like fentanyl and heroin drive dangerous use.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 619.42,
      "end_time": 623.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Every day, 224 people die from overdose.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 623.66,
      "end_time": 627.02
    },
    {
      "text": "And the US that's like the equivalent of a plane crash every day.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 627.02,
      "end_time": 631.53
    },
    {
      "text": "For each overdose death, there are as.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 631.85,
      "end_time": 633.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Many as 39 fatal overdoses.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 633.97,
      "end_time": 636.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Only 13% of those who need care receive medicine for opioid use disorder known as Moud.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 636.65,
      "end_time": 643.53
    },
    {
      "text": "87% community cost is $96 billion each.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 643.77,
      "end_time": 648.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Staggering figure we stick to.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 649.69,
      "end_time": 651.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Just.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 653.72,
      "end_time": 653.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Just got a message from him.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 653.92,
      "end_time": 656.04
    },
    {
      "text": "He said we.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 656.04,
      "end_time": 657.16
    },
    {
      "text": "He would like to reschedule and he can make it if.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 657.16,
      "end_time": 661.96
    },
    {
      "text": "My apologies.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 661.96,
      "end_time": 662.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know why this happened at the last moment, but I'll make sure to reschedule that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 662.88,
      "end_time": 669.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to use your calendar link.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 671.32,
      "end_time": 673.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I think that helps me also.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 673.96,
      "end_time": 677
    },
    {
      "text": "Glenn, just.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 677,
      "end_time": 677.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I was going to send an email.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 677.68,
      "end_time": 679
    },
    {
      "text": "So if we have to request some data requests regarding the financials, would you be able to avoid that?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 679.08,
      "end_time": 686.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 687.84,
      "end_time": 688.16
    },
    {
      "text": "What does that mean exactly?",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 688.16,
      "end_time": 689.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, the answer is yes, but they would have to be yes.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 690.08,
      "end_time": 694.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 694.88,
      "end_time": 695.68
    },
    {
      "text": "So like the last three years income statement, balance sheet.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 695.68,
      "end_time": 699.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Last three is income and balance balance.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 704.96,
      "end_time": 707.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 707.96,
      "end_time": 708.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Tax returns.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 708.56,
      "end_time": 709.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Could you.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 712.94,
      "end_time": 713.42
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, could you just send me an email so I can just.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 713.5,
      "end_time": 715.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, sure, sure, sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 716.38,
      "end_time": 717.74
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm gonna send you an email.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 718.3,
      "end_time": 719.46
    },
    {
      "text": "I.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 719.46,
      "end_time": 719.74
    },
    {
      "text": "I just wanted to like, confirm so that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 719.74,
      "end_time": 721.5
    },
    {
      "text": "But I'm gonna send you a formal email after this call.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 723.18,
      "end_time": 726.38
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll also send you a secure data loop.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 728.06,
      "end_time": 730.26
    },
    {
      "text": "So it was there only.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 730.26,
      "end_time": 732.3
    },
    {
      "text": "We control it.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 732.78,
      "end_time": 733.74
    },
    {
      "text": "It's tightly controlled.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 733.74,
      "end_time": 734.98
    },
    {
      "text": "We get to.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 734.98,
      "end_time": 735.52
    },
    {
      "text": "To let whoever can access that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 735.67,
      "end_time": 738.23
    },
    {
      "text": "No one can download anything from there.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 738.39,
      "end_time": 740.55
    },
    {
      "text": "It's all.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 740.55,
      "end_time": 741.03
    },
    {
      "text": "So you can be assured that it's a very safe place for the data.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 741.51,
      "end_time": 745.59
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, I wanted to update, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 745.91,
      "end_time": 749.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you so much, Glenn.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 749.79,
      "end_time": 751.03
    },
    {
      "text": "It's unfortunate that he couldn't join us, but I'm gonna reschedule and we are also chasing down the other buyers, so hopefully we'll have more comments in the pipeline as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 751.429,
      "end_time": 761.14
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, the last two that you sent me I thought were particularly interesting because they're.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 761.21,
      "end_time": 766.45
    },
    {
      "text": "They're definitely in the same marketplace that's also quite different.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 766.45,
      "end_time": 771.05
    },
    {
      "text": "And so I was really.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 771.05,
      "end_time": 772.25
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very curious as to the outcome there, but I'll.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 772.49,
      "end_time": 776.61
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll leave that to you to manage that workflow.",
      "speaker_name": "Glen McDermott",
      "start_time": 776.61,
      "end_time": 779.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I mean, they were different, and they're unique.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 779.53,
      "end_time": 782.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Your agency is really unique.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 782.29,
      "end_time": 783.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Like, the stuff they do is, like, really attractive to a lot of buyers.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 783.81,
      "end_time": 787.81
    },
    {
      "text": "So we got a lot of initial interest, but I think people are on call with this or something.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 787.81,
      "end_time": 792.09
    },
    {
      "text": "So the responses.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 792.09,
      "end_time": 793.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Relatively slow, but, yeah, definitely we have those in the pipeline, and we'll be definitely scheduling more clouds in the coming weeks.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 793.35,
      "end_time": 800.47
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'd also like your critique on my deck.",
